{"id":"enseigne_","lemma":"enseigné","pos":"adj","rank":4115,"glosses":["taught","indicated"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.sɛ.ɲe/","forms":{"feminine":"enseignée","masculinePlural":"enseignés","femininePlural":"enseignées"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-MrStrelok75-enseign%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Qui vous a enseigné le français ?","en":"Who taught you French?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/472412","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Vous nous avez beaucoup enseigné.","en":"You've taught us a great deal.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Qui vous a enseigné comment faire cela ?","en":"Who taught you how to do that?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Tu nous l'as enseigné.","en":"You taught us that.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null]},{"text":"J'ai aussi enseigné le français.","en":"I taught French, too.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"French"}]}]}